{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-6-24","kind":"proposition","title":"平行线方形的两角线方形自相似亦与全形相似","englishTitle":"In any parallelogram the parallelograms about the diameter are similar both to the whole and to one another.","book":6,"number":24,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.24","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.24/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":24,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-6-24@raw-c6cb4c30048fe64f","contentId":"euclid-6-24","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c6cb4c30048fe64f69959bd39c6883469ff6a7e4e73b542348953beead9fb3fa","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-6-24.statement","euclid-6-24.construction.1","euclid-6-24.proof.1","euclid-6-24.proof.2","euclid-6-24.proof.3","euclid-6-24.proof.4","euclid-6-24.proof.5","euclid-6-24.proof.6","euclid-6-24.proof.7","euclid-6-24.proof.8","euclid-6-24.proof.9","euclid-6-24.proof.10","euclid-6-24.proof.11","euclid-6-24.conclusion","euclid-6-24.historical.1","euclid-6-24.historical.2","euclid-6-24.historical.3","euclid-6-24.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-6-24.statement","contentId":"euclid-6-24","revisionId":"euclid-6-24@raw-c6cb4c30048fe64f","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"86fc72ae9bc181ec6935b9714d06b7c531443ff82755e02e4e6f178b90002dcf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In any parallelogram the parallelograms about the diameter are similar both to the whole and to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在任何平行四边形中,对角线为平行四边形的距离与整个和彼此相似。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"平行线方形之两角线方形自相似亦与全形相似"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两角平行的方形是自相似且类似于全长方形"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-24.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-6-24","revisionId":"euclid-6-24@raw-c6cb4c30048fe64f","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"07be7de0388a70116605f6e00c8e9bb29d40b1cfd2955e15bb958ab62c40d79f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABCD be a parallelogram, and AC its diameter, and let EG, HK be parallelograms about AC; I say that each of the parallelograms EG, HK is similar both to the whole ABCD and to the other."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABCD是平行四边形,AC对角线,让EG,HK是平行四边形,约AC;我说,平行四边形,EG,HK与整个ABCD和另一个相似。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-24.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-6-24","revisionId":"euclid-6-24@raw-c6cb4c30048fe64f","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6912e38a7dbed4eb782b4fe9dc662dd1d09690239639f80a08b7c600bc9f365c","citations":["euclid-6-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since EF has been drawn parallel to BC, one of the sides of the triangle ABC, proportionally, as BE is to EA, so is CF to FA. [[VI. 2](/principles/euclid-6-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为EF比BC,三角形的一面ABC,BE比EA的比例等于CF比FA；BE 与 EA 之比等于 CF 与 FA 之比。 [[VI. 2](/principles/euclid-6-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-24.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-6-24","revisionId":"euclid-6-24@raw-c6cb4c30048fe64f","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8216eb855824c0d3ead75cbec02c91209992bf9190ac52148952970c785a5aaf","citations":["euclid-6-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since FG has been drawn parallel to CD, one of the sides of the triangle ACD, proportionally, as CF is to FA, so is DG to GA. [[VI. 2](/principles/euclid-6-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于FG比CD,三角形ACD的一边,CF比FA的比例等于DG比GA；CF 与 FA 之比等于 DG 与 GA 之比。 [[VI. 2](/principles/euclid-6-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-24.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-6-24","revisionId":"euclid-6-24@raw-c6cb4c30048fe64f","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7ab3c17cb91a3d15ca05fc527dabcb8554249d792e5d94b7f2d0d84cfe934b9f","citations":["euclid-5-18","euclid-5-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it was proved that, as CF is to FA, so also is BE to EA; therefore also, as BE is to EA, so is DG to GA, and therefore, componendo, as BA is to AE, so is DA to AG, [[V. 18](/principles/euclid-5-18)] and, alternately, as BA is to AD, so is EA to AG. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但事实证明,CF为FA,BE为EA;因此,BE为EA,DG为GA,BA为AE,DA为AG,而BA为AD,EA为AG；BE 与 EA 之比等于 DG 与 GA 之比；BA 与 AE 之比等于 DA 与 AG 之比；BA 与 AD 之比等于 EA 与 AG 之比。 [[V. 18](/principles/euclid-5-18)] [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-24.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-6-24","revisionId":"euclid-6-24@raw-c6cb4c30048fe64f","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0f38630206fea188e1def3bcca4b8857b33f4cecaf3025b9775e2cbd4d38e19d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore in the parallelograms ABCD, EG, the sides about the common angle BAD are proportional."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在平行四边形 ABCD EG公路上,共同角度BAD的两边是成比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-24.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-6-24","revisionId":"euclid-6-24@raw-c6cb4c30048fe64f","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"98ae4eee3efc4f3bef9642d852dab0338d0b46eb25efa780958691d8fb99463a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since GF is parallel to DC, the angle AFG is equal to the angle DCA; and the angle DAC is common to the two triangles ADC, AGF; therefore the triangle ADC is equiangular with the triangle AGF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于GF与DC平行,AFG角等于DCA角;DAC角与两个三角ADC,AGF是共同的;因此,三角ADC是同三角AGF的等角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-24.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-6-24","revisionId":"euclid-6-24@raw-c6cb4c30048fe64f","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2859076a555d2372685812def6eac661068f92c1a6ca3325056d7fca9da441ad","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the triangle ACB is also equiangular with the triangle AFE, and the whole parallelogram ABCD is equiangular with the parallelogram EG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,三角形ACB也是与三角形AFE的对角形,整个三角形平行四边形 ABCD是同形形平行四边形 EG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-24.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-6-24","revisionId":"euclid-6-24@raw-c6cb4c30048fe64f","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d73633a5c44841f717b15f3bf6387dd517abb1197e1abef0e684c2df6a9b3732","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, proportionally, as AD is to DC, so is AG to GF, as DC is to CA, so is GF to FA, as AC is to CB, so is AF to FE, and further, as CB is to BA, so is FE to EA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AD比DC的比例相当于AG比GF,DC比CA等于GF比FA,AC比CB等于AF比FE,BA比FE比EA；AD 与 DC 之比等于 AG 与 GF 之比；DC 与 CA 之比等于 GF 与 FA 之比；AC 与 CB 之比等于 AF 与 FE 之比；CB 与 BA 之比等于 FE 与 EA 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-24.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-6-24","revisionId":"euclid-6-24@raw-c6cb4c30048fe64f","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c1c6cb3bf249a2700f5dfff3140dd1fe302e34304ed75ec4a5313ae868a5ca57","citations":["euclid-5-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since it was proved that, as DC is to CA, so is GF to FA, and, as AC is to CB, so is AF to FE, therefore, ex aequali, as DC is to CB, so is GF to FE. [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于DC比CA等同GF比FA,AC比CB等同AF比FE,因此,在平等的基础上,DC比CB等同GF比FE；DC 与 CA 之比等于 GF 与 FA 之比；AC 与 CB 之比等于 AF 与 FE 之比；DC 与 CB 之比等于 GF 与 FE 之比。 [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-24.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-6-24","revisionId":"euclid-6-24@raw-c6cb4c30048fe64f","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"49fdf95792d9ad0f6e4b6c6e7f6acb754d3fe7e0b75a208cdc3b4d70e0644b43","citations":["euclid-6-def-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore in the parallelograms ABCD, EG the sides about the equal angles are proportional; therefore the parallelogram ABCD is similar to the parallelogram EG. [[VI. Def. 1](/principles/euclid-6-def-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在平行四边形 ABCD EG 中,关于平等角度的两边为 成比例;因此,平行四边形 ABCD 与平行四边形 EG 相类似。 [[VI. Def. 1](/principles/euclid-6-def-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-24.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-6-24","revisionId":"euclid-6-24@raw-c6cb4c30048fe64f","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d7e3ec25ae7b8a03a2c97de9864abbfbe55da7fc0a3061073948e91db3e438fb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the parallelogram ABCD is also similar to the parallelogram KH; therefore each of the parallelograms EG, HK is similar to ABCD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,平行四边形 ABCD也与平行四边形 KH类似;因此,平行四边形 EG HK中,每个都与ABCD相似。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-24.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-6-24","revisionId":"euclid-6-24@raw-c6cb4c30048fe64f","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0f339dc4b7ef6eedb433b7f3374f2391c73cf024319afe97a02341424aa1b440","citations":["euclid-6-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But figures similar to the same rectilineal figure are also similar to one another; [[VI. 21](/principles/euclid-6-21)] therefore the parallelogram EG is also similar to the parallelogram HK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但与同一直线数字相类似的数字也相似;因此,平行四边形 EG数字也与平行四边形 HK数字类似。 [[VI. 21](/principles/euclid-6-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-24.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-6-24","revisionId":"euclid-6-24@raw-c6cb4c30048fe64f","order":13,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-24.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-6-24","revisionId":"euclid-6-24@raw-c6cb4c30048fe64f","order":14,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e573f8e759244028cb582333654029c0d80a15eb8953fc7a63258645f7f64373","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"平行线方形之两角线方形自相似亦与全形相似"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两角平行的方形是自相似且类似于全长方形"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-24.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-6-24","revisionId":"euclid-6-24@raw-c6cb4c30048fe64f","order":15,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3b13ec45cccf88a9e53611375a89c7cc1ba313f454e69b950b2a7150dcfc600a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙丁平行方形作甲丙对角线任作戊己庚辛两线与丁丙乙丙平行而与对角线交相遇于壬题言戊庚己辛两角线方形自相似亦与全形相似"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：甲乙丙丁平行四边形作甲丙对角线任作戊己庚辛两线与丁丙乙丙平行而与对角线交相遇于壬命题说明戊庚己辛两角线方形自相似亦与全形相似"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-24.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-6-24","revisionId":"euclid-6-24@raw-c6cb4c30048fe64f","order":16,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"206c6e98e2cad53b9aa27e35272b380847b760f3e392118040a9dae1d6247c69","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试依一卷廿九题推显两角线形等角又庚甲戊与乙甲丁同角而甲戊壬外角与甲丁丙内角等甲庚壬外角与甲乙丙内角等戊壬庚外角与乙己壬内角等乙己壬外角又与乙丙丁内角等则戊庚形与甲丙全形等角矣依显己辛形亦与全形等角矣今欲显两形与全形相似者试观甲庚壬与甲乙丙两角形甲戊壬与甲丁丙两角形既各等角〈一卷廿九〉〈可推仍见本篇四之系〉即甲乙与乙丙之比例若甲庚与庚壬而庚乙两角旁各两边之比例等也〈六卷四〉又乙丙与丙甲之比例若庚壬与壬甲丙甲与丙丁之比例若壬甲与壬戊平之即乙丙与丙丁若庚壬与壬戊也〈五卷廿二〉则乙丙丁庚壬戊两角旁各两边之比例等也依显各角旁各両边之比例皆等是两角线方形自相似亦与全形相似"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：试依一卷廿九题推显两角线形等角又庚甲戊与乙甲丁同角而甲戊壬外角与甲丁丙内角等甲庚壬外角与甲乙丙内角等戊壬庚外角与乙己壬内角等乙己壬外角又与乙丙丁内角等则戊庚形与甲丙全形等角矣依显己辛形亦与全形等角矣今欲显两形与全形相似者试观甲庚壬与甲乙丙两三角形甲戊壬与甲丁丙两三角形既各等角〈一卷廿九〉〈可推仍见本篇四之系〉即甲乙与乙丙之比例若甲庚与庚壬而庚乙两角旁各两边之比例等也〈六卷四〉又乙丙与丙甲之比例若庚壬与壬甲丙甲与丙丁之比例若壬甲与壬戊平之即乙丙与丙丁若庚壬与壬戊也〈五卷廿二〉则乙丙丁庚壬戊两角旁各两边之比例等也依显各角旁各両边之比例皆等是两角线方形自相似亦与全形相似"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-24.source","contentId":"euclid-6-24","revisionId":"euclid-6-24@raw-c6cb4c30048fe64f","order":17,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"97d4da98cafa48d52ac6be06818ddf764d4cce03f906d65f7d568a5269008bff","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.24/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.24\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-6-24:euclid-6-2:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-24","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-24.proof.1","euclid-6-24.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-2","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.24","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.24/","sourceLabel":"VI. 2"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-24:euclid-5-18:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-24","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-24.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-18","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.24","sourceUrl":"https://s